flowchart LR
  A[Workflow or change event] --> B[Tools, data, credentials, and actions]
  B --> C[Risk review artifact]
  C --> D[Controls, logs, approvals, and rollback]
  D --> E{Launch blocked?}
  E -->|Yes| F[Blockers and remediation]
  E -->|No| G[Security signoff memo]
